# 2026-11-17 · full system S at the 4B scale, local (RTX 3060 Laptop, 6 GB), Ollama 0.40.7
# Usage: OLLAMA_CONTEXT_LENGTH=8192 ollama serve
#        set -a; source configs/2026-11-17_small_models.env; set +a
#        PYTHONPATH=src .venv/bin/python -m inspector.main --split dev --run-name dev_full_S
#
# Decided on dev (Nov 16), see results/compare/:
# - Expert hint ON for every source: +6.8 points on 82 dev images with Qwen3-VL-4B, gains on every
#   source including GoodsAD (2026-11-16_hint).
# - Verifier = Gemma 4 E2B (another family than both readers; 4.6B total, fits in 6 GB). E4B (7.5B total)
#   gave no better reopens on the 9-image smoke run and is 40 % slower (2026-11-16_smoke_critic).
# - Gemma thinking OFF: without it Gemma spends max_new_tokens reasoning and returns empty content.
ONEREF_LLM_BASE_URL=http://localhost:11434/v1
ONEREF_LLM_API_KEY=ollama
ONEREF_READER_A_MODEL=qwen3-vl:4b-instruct
ONEREF_READER_B_MODEL=hf.co/bartowski/OpenGVLab_InternVL3_5-4B-GGUF:Q4_K_M
ONEREF_USE_LLM_CRITIC=true
ONEREF_CRITIC_MODEL=gemma4:e2b
ONEREF_CRITIC_EXTRA_BODY='{"reasoning_effort": "none"}'

# Expert calibration (dev, 2026-11-12): global threshold 0.165 on the DINOv3 peak distance.
ONEREF_ANOMALY_NORM_LOW=0.065
ONEREF_ANOMALY_NORM_HIGH=0.265
